<title>HONG KONG: Lippo 1996 net profit down 3.96 pct.</title>
<headline>Lippo 1996 net profit down 3.96 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   82.0	  vs 85.0</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    13.0	  vs 12.5</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  231.16 gain vs 219.38 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    355.80	vs 370.46</p>
<p>    Turnover		     3,567.05    vs 2,431.99 (adjusted)</p>
<p>    Company name		 Lippo Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  June 20-27</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   July 18</p>
<p>NOTE - Lippo provides financial services.</p>
<p>Comparative turnover has been adjusted to include that of banking operations.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain of HK$202.79 million on disposal of investment properties, gain of HK$52.99 million on disposal on disposal of an associated company and loss of HK$24.62 million on partial provision for premium payable on redemption of convertible notes issued by a subsidiary.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 20 H.K. cents (including interim dividend of seven cents) vs 19.5 cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
